test "rank301: CairoSVG rgb regex has overlapping whitespace groups"
lang python
expect VYQL-DOS-003
expect_review code.CatastrophicRegex
code
```
import re

RGBA = re.compile(r'rgba\([ \n\r\t]*(.+?)[ \n\r\t]*\)')
RGB = re.compile(r'rgb\([ \n\r\t]*(.+?)[ \n\r\t]*\)')

def color(string, opacity=1):
    match = RGB.search(string)
    if match:
        return tuple(match.group(1).split(','))
```

test "rank301: CairoSVG rgb regex trims matched body after simple capture"
lang python
reject VYQL-DOS-003
reject_review code.CatastrophicRegex
code
```
import re

RGBA = re.compile(r'rgba\((.+?)\)')
RGB = re.compile(r'rgb\((.+?)\)')

def color(string, opacity=1):
    match = RGB.search(string)
    if match:
        return tuple(match.group(1).strip().split(','))
```
